Wanda 3.1.0 (master @ ad8876cb2fa3): UTF-8-safe truncation + configurable search candidates

Preserve UTF-8 boundaries when truncating LLM context, and substitute invalid
UTF-8 in outgoing LLM and search JSON. Provider requests now share LLMClient.
WandaSearchCandidates configures the hybrid chat retrieval pool before namespace
and read-permission filtering (default 10, matching Wanda 3.1.0).

Apply from the MediaWiki root: patch -p1 -d /var/www/html < wanda-utf8-truncation.patch

